## 3. Jobs-to-be-done and current-state journey

### 3.1 Core jobs-to-be-done

1. **When a referral arrives fragmented, help intake determine which administrative evidence applies and what is usable, so the order can move without relying on memory.**
2. **When evidence is missing or conflicting, help the right supplier or clinic person complete one precise cure, so callbacks and duplicate faxes stop.**
3. **When shipment is imminent, help an authorized employee understand residual risk and record release/hold/override, so no machine makes the consequential decision.**
4. **When a policy changes, help compliance approve, test, publish, and later reproduce the applicable version, so date boundaries do not create silent errors.**
5. **When an ADR/TPE/RAC arrives, help compliance assemble unchanged evidence and decision history, so response time and omission risk fall.**

